bugging tools. For developers only.":["Kapcsolj be egy \u00faj f\u00fclet hibakeres\u0151 eszk\u00f6z\u00f6kkel. Csak fejleszt\u0151knek."],"Constantly and discreetly cleans your database in bite-sized tasks, keeping your site's speed unaffected. All the items set with \"Auto\" will be processed.":["Folyamatosan, \u00e9szrev\u00e9tlen\u00fcl, kisebb feladatokban tiszt\u00edtja az adatb\u00e1zisodat, \u00edgy nem befoly\u00e1solja a webhely sebess\u00e9g\u00e9t. Az \u201eautomatikus\u201d be\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00e1ssal megadott t\u00e9telek feldolgoz\u00e1sra ker\u00fclnek."],"This is fake data! \ud83d\ude0e":["Ez hamis adat! \ud83d\ude0e"],"Welcome to the Database Cleaner Dashboard.":["\u00dcdv\u00f6zl\u00fcnk a Database Cleaner vez\u00e9rl\u0151pultj\u00e1n."],"Posts":["Bejegyz\u00e9sek"],"Posts Metadata":["Bejegyz\u00e9sek metaadatai"],"Users":["Felhaszn\u00e1l\u00f3k"],"Comments":["Hozz\u00e1sz\u00f3l\u00e1sok"],"Transients":["\u00c1tmeneti adatok"],"Post Types":["Bejegyz\u00e9st\u00edpusok"],"Auto Refresh is disabled. You can enable it in the Settings tab.":["Az automatikus friss\u00edt\u00e9s ki van kapcsolva. A be\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00e1sok f\u00fcl\u00f6n bekapcsolhatod."],"Based on the nature of meta duplicates, it is better to do it manually":["A duplik\u00e1lt metaadatok jelleg\u00e9b\u0151l ad\u00f3d\u00f3an jobb ezt manu\u00e1lisan elv\u00e9gezni"],"Details":["R\u00e9szletek"],"Count":["Darabsz\u00e1m"],"Mode":["M\u00f3d"],"Post Type":["Bejegyz\u00e9s t\u00edpusa"],"Size":["M\u00e9ret"],"Relative %":["Relat\u00edv %"],"Auto":["Automatikus"],"Schedule":["\u00dctemez\u00e9s"],"Next Run":["K\u00f6vetkez\u0151 futtat\u00e1s"],"Name":["N\u00e9v"],"Value":["\u00c9rt\u00e9k"],"Action":["M\u0171velet"],"Post ID":["Bejegyz\u00e9s ID"],"User ID":["Felhaszn\u00e1l\u00f3i azonos\u00edt\u00f3 (ID)"],"All":["Mind"],"Not Used":["Nem haszn\u00e1lt"],"Used":["Haszn\u00e1lt"],"Autoloaded":["Automatikusan bet\u00f6lt\u00f6tt"],"Not Autoloaded":["Nem automatikusan bet\u00f6lt\u01