s\/database-cleaner-pro\/' target='_blank'>Database Cleaner Pro<\/a>. And don't hesitate to <a href='https:\/\/meowapps.com\/contact' target='_blank'>contact me<\/a> for a discount! \ud83d\udc95":["A Database Cleaner <b>Pro verzi\u00f3ja<\/b> sokkal t\u00f6bbet tud az adatok felhaszn\u00e1l\u00e1s\u00e1r\u00f3l, \u00e9s ezt neked is leegyszer\u0171s\u00edtheti! K\u00e9rlek, tekintsd meg a <a href='https:\/\/meowapps.com\/products\/database-cleaner-pro\/' target='_blank'>Database Cleaner Pro<\/a>-t. \u00c9s ne habozz <a href='https:\/\/meowapps.com\/contact' target='_blank'>felvenni velem a kapcsolatot<\/a> kedvezm\u00e9ny\u00e9rt! \ud83d\udc95"],"Please visit the <b>Settings<\/b> tab to access all your <b>Used By<\/b> data. Don't hesitate to share it <a href='https:\/\/meowapps.com\/support\/' target='_blank'>with me<\/a> so that I can make this plugin better.":["L\u00e1togass el a <b>be\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00e1sok<\/b> f\u00fclre, hogy hozz\u00e1f\u00e9rj az \u00f6sszes <b>haszn\u00e1lati adatodhoz<\/b>. Ne habozz <a href='https:\/\/meowapps.com\/support\/' target='_blank'>megosztani velem<\/a> ezeket, hogy jobb\u00e1 tehessem ezt a b\u0151v\u00edtm\u00e9nyt."],"Edit Custom Query":["Egy\u00e9ni lek\u00e9rdez\u00e9s szerkeszt\u00e9se"],"Save":["Ment\u00e9s"],"Option: {0}":["Be\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00e1s: {0}"],"STEP":["L\u00c9P\u00c9S"],"Getting tasks...":["Feladatok lek\u00e9r\u00e9se..."],"Cleaning items...":["Elemek tiszt\u00edt\u00e1sa..."],"The process has finished, but {0} error(s) occurred.":["A folyamat befejez\u0151d\u00f6tt, de {0} hiba t\u00f6rt\u00e9nt."],"Refresh the counts":["Darabsz\u00e1mok friss\u00edt\u00e9se"],"Delete the selected items":["A kijel\u00f6lt elemek t\u00f6rl\u00e9se"],"Delete the data older than the date threshold":["A d\u00e1tumk\u00fcsz\u00f6bn\u00e9l r\u00e9gebbi adatok t\u00f6rl\u00e9se"],"Assign Plugin for Selected Items":["B\u0151v\u00edtm\u00e9ny hozz\u00e1rendel\u00e9se a kijel\u00f6lt elemekhez"],"While using Database Cleaner is easy, I strongly recommend you to read the <a href='https:\/\/meowapps.com\/database-cleaner\/tutorial\/' target='_blank'>tutorial<\/a> carefully. This plugin has more capabilities than other plugins of the same kind, so you might find new and interesting ways to handle your cleanups. I recommend enabling <strong>Auto-Refresh Counts<\/strong> in the Settings, which will automatically display the main items to clean in WordPress Core, and using <strong>Auto Clean<\/strong> for regular maintenance. If any issue, or feature request, please let me know on the <a href='https:\/\/wordpress.org\/support\/plugin\/database-cleaner\/' target='_blank'>WordPress Forums<\/a>. <b>Last but not least, backup your DB before doing anything!<\/b> If you don't know how, give a try to <a href='http:\/\/meow.click\/blogvault' target='_blank'>BlogVault<\/a>. ":["B\u00e1r a Database Cleaner haszn\u00e1lata egyszer\u0171, nyomat\u00e9kosan javaslom, hogy figyelmesen olvasd el az <a href='https:\/\/meowapps.com\/database-cleaner\/tutorial\/' target='_blank'>\u00fatmutat\u00f3t<\/a>. Ez a b\u0151v\u00edtm\u00e9ny t\u00f6bb lehet\u0151s\u00e9get k\u00edn\u00e1l, mint a hasonl\u00f3 b\u0151v\u00edtm\u00e9nyek, ez\u00e9rt \u00faj \u00e9s \u00e9rdekes m\u00f3dszereket is tal\u00e1lhatsz a tiszt\u00edt\u00e1si feladatok kezel\u00e9s\u00e9re. Javaslom, hogy kapcsold be az <strong>automatikus darabsz\u00e1mfriss\u00edt\u00e9s<\/strong> funkci\u00f3t a be\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00e1sokban, amely automatikusan megjelen\u00edti a WordPress-alaprendszerben tiszt\u00edtand\u00f3 f\u0151 t\u00e9teleket, \u00e9s haszn\u00e1ld az <strong>automatikus tiszt\u00edt\u00e1s<\/strong> funkci\u00f3t a rendszeres karbantart\u00e1shoz. Ha probl\u00e9m\u00e1t tapasztalsz, vagy funkci\u00f3k\u00e9r\u00e9sed van, jelezd a <a href='https:\/\/wordpress.org\/support\/plugin\/database-cleaner\/' target='_blank'>WordPress-f\u00f3rumon<\/a>. <b>V\u00e9g\u00fcl, de nem utols\u00f3sorban, minden m\u0171velet el\u0151tt k\u00e9sz\u00edts biztons\u00e1gi m\u00e1solatot az adatb\u00e1zisodr\u00f3l!<\/b> Ha nem tudod, hogyan tedd, pr\u00f3b\u00e1ld ki a <a href='http:\/\/meow.click\/blogvault' target='_blank'>BlogVault<\/a> szolg\u00e1ltat\u00e1st."],"Auto Clean":["Automatikus tiszt\u00edt\u00e1s"],"TODAY":["MA"],"WordPress Core":["WordPress-alaprendszer"],"List Post Types":["Bejegyz\u00e9st\u00edpusok list\u00e1z\u00e1sa"],"Tables":["T\u00e1bl\u00e1k"],"Options":["Be\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00e1sok"],"Cron Jobs":["Cron-feladatok"],"Custom Queries":["Egy\u00e9ni lek\u00e9rdez\u00e9sek"],"Settings & Logs":["Be\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00e1sok \u00e9s napl\u00f3k"],"License":["Licenc"],"The <strong>Auto Clean<\/strong> button removes old items from your database when clicked. The <strong>Age Threshold<\/strong> determines how old items must be before they are cleaned. <strong>Nyao Sweeper<\/strong> is a scheduled task that automatically runs Auto Clean at regular intervals.":["Az <strong>automatikus tiszt\u00edt\u00e1s<\/strong> gomb kattint\u00e1sra elt\u00e1vol\u00edtja a r\u00e9gi t\u00e9teleket az adatb\u00e1zisodb\u00f3l. A <strong>kor szerinti k\u00fcsz\u00f6b\u00e9rt\u00e9k<\/strong> hat\u00e1rozza meg, hogy a t\u00e9teleknek milyen r\u00e9ginek kell lenni\u00fck a tiszt\u00edt\u00e1shoz. A <strong>Nyao Sweeper<\/strong> egy \u00fctemezett feladat, amely rendszeres id\u0151k\u00f6z\u00f6nk\u00e9nt automatikusan futtatja az automatikus tiszt\u00edt\u00e1st."],"Age Threshold":["Kor szerinti k\u00fcsz\u00f6b\u00e9rt\u00e9k"],"Only items older than this threshold will be cleaned.":["Csak az enn\u00e9l r\u00e9gebbi t\u00e9telek lesznek megtiszt\u00edtva."],"Message":["\u00dczenet"],"Have you read it twice? If yes, hide it :)":["Elolvastad k\u00e9tszer is? Ha igen, rejtsd el :)"],"Performance":["Teljes\u00edtm\u00e9ny"],"Batch Size":["K\u00f6tegm\u00e9ret"],"The maximum amount of entries to delete at the same time. That will slow down the process a little but will make it work on huge databases.":["Az egyszerre t\u00f6r\u00f6lhet\u0151 bejegyz\u00e9sek maxim\u00e1lis sz\u00e1ma. Ez kiss\u00e9 lelass\u00edtja a folyamatot, de \u00edgy hatalmas adatb\u00e1zisok eset\u00e9n is m\u0171k\u00f6dik."],"Delay (in ms)":["K\u00e9sleltet\u00e9s (ms-ben)"],"Time to wait between each request (in milliseconds). The overall process is intensive so this gives the chance to your server to chill out a bit. A very good server doesn't need it, but a slow\/shared hosting might even reject requests if they are too fast and frequent. Recommended value is actually 0, 100 for safety, 2000 or 5000 if your hosting is kind of cheap.":["Az egyes k\u00e9r\u00e9sek k\u00f6z\u00f6tti v\u00e1rakoz\u00e1si id\u0151 (ezredm\u00e1sodpercben). A teljes folyamat er\u0151forr\u00e1s-ig\u00e9nyes, ez\u00e9rt ezzel a szervered is fell\u00e9legezhet egy kicsit. Egy nagyon j\u00f3 szervernek nincs r\u00e1 sz\u00fcks\u00e9ge, de lass\u00fa vagy megosztott t\u00e1rhely eset\u00e9n a t\u00fal gyors \u00e9s gyakori k\u00e9r\u00e9seket ak\u00e1r el is utas\u00edthatj\u00e1k. Val\u00f3j\u00e1ban 0 az aj\u00e1nlott \u00e9rt\u00e9k; a biztons\u00e1g kedv\u00e9\u00e9rt 100, olcs\u00f3 t\u00e1rhely eset\u00e9n pedig 2000 vagy 5000."],"Deep Deletions":["M\u00e9lyrehat\u00f3 t\u00f6rl\u00e9s"],"Items will be deleted by calling the internal WordPress functions, so it will have the side effect of a <i>natural cleaning<\/i>, as if you were deleting posts (and other elements) naturally.":["A t\u00e9telek t\u00f6rl\u00e9se a WordPress bels\u0151 f\u00fcggv\u00e9nyeinek megh\u00edv\u00e1s\u00e1val t\u00f6rt\u00e9nik, \u00edgy ennek mell\u00e9khat\u00e1sak\u00e9nt <i>term\u00e9szetes tiszt\u00edt\u00e1s<\/i> megy v\u00e9gbe, mintha term\u00e9szetes m\u00f3don t\u00f6r\u00f6ln\u00e9d a bejegyz\u00e9seket (\u00e9s m\u00e1s t\u00e9teleket)."],"Custom <i>Used By<\/i> data":["Egy\u00e9ni <i>Used By<\/i> adatok"],"Reset Used By":["Used By vissza\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00e1sa"],"Did you categorize everything? Nice! \u263a\ufe0f Please share this data with me through my <a href='https:\/\/meowapps.com\/contact' target='_blank'>contact form<\/a>. Thank you! ":["Mindent kategoriz\u00e1lt\u00e1l? Remek! \u263a\ufe0f K\u00e9rlek, oszd meg velem ezeket az adatokat a <a href='https:\/\/meowapps.com\/contact' target='_blank'>kapcsolatfelv\u00e9teli \u0171rlapon<\/a>. K\u00f6sz\u00f6n\u00f6m! "],"POST TYPES":["BEJEGYZ\u00c9ST\u00cdPUSOK"],"OPTIONS":["BE\u00c1LL\u00cdT\u00c1SOK"],"TABLES":["T\u00c1BL\u00c1K"],"CRON JOBS":["CRON FELADATOK"],"For Advanced Users & Developers":["Halad\u00f3 felhaszn\u00e1l\u00f3k \u00e9s fejleszt\u0151k sz\u00e1m\u00e1ra"],"Reset Options":["Opci\u00f3k alaphelyzetbe \u00e1ll\u00edt\u00e1sa"],"Generate Fake Data":["Hamis adatok gener\u00e1l\u00e1sa"],"Nyao Sweeper":["Nyao Sweeper"],"Perform Next Task":["K\u00f6vetkez\u0151 feladat v\u00e9grehajt\u00e1sa"],"Reset Tasks":["Feladatok alaphelyzetbe \u00e1ll\u00edt\u00e1sa"],"Enable Scheduled Auto-Clean":["\u00dctemezett automatikus tiszt\u00edt\u00e1s bekapcsol\u00e1sa"],"Hourly":["\u00d3r\u00e1nk\u00e9nt"],"Twice Daily":["Naponta k\u00e9tszer"],"Daily":["Napi"],"Enabled":["Bekapcsolva"],"Modules":["Modulok"],"Build Indexes":["Indexek l\u00e9trehoz\u00e1sa"],"Remove Indexes":["Indexek elt\u00e1vol\u00edt\u00e1sa"],"Stuck Reset":["Elakad\u00e1s eset\u00e9n alaphelyzetbe \u00e1ll\u00edt\u00e1s"],"Automatically stop and reset the Sweeper if a task runs longer than this many hours.":["Automatikusan le\u00e1ll\u00edtja \u00e9s alaphelyzetbe \u00e1ll\u00edtja a Sweeper eszk\u00f6zt, ha egy feladat enn\u00e9l t\u00f6bb \u00f3r\u00e1n \u00e1t fut."],"Auto-Refresh Counts":["Sz\u00e1ml\u00e1l\u00f3k automatikus friss\u00edt\u00e9se"],"Automatically refresh counts when opening the plugin. Disable if you have a very large database.":["A b\u0151v\u00edtm\u00e9ny megnyit\u00e1sakor automatikusan friss\u00edti a sz\u00e1ml\u00e1l\u00f3kat. Ha nagyon nagy az adatb\u00e1zisod, kapcsold ki."],"Protected Items":["V\u00e9dett t\u00e9telek"],"Enable Deletion":["T\u00f6rl\u00e9s bekapcsol\u00e1sa"],"Protected items are those with blue buttons, disabled by default because they are used by WordPress or plugins. Enable this if you are sure you want to delete them.":["A v\u00e9dett t\u00e9telek azok, amelyeken k\u00e9k gombok l\u00e1that\u00f3k. A t\u00f6rl\u00e9s\u00fck alap\u00e9rtelmez\u00e9s szerint ki van kapcsolva, mert a WordPress vagy a b\u0151v\u00edtm\u00e9nyek haszn\u00e1lj\u00e1k \u0151ket. Csak akkor kapcsold be ezt, ha biztosan t\u00f6r\u00f6lni szeretn\u00e9d \u0151ket."],"MCP":["MCP"],"Registers the Database Cleaner tools in the MCP server of AI Engine, so an AI assistant can inspect the database, report what is worth cleaning, and clean it up. The tools explain what is protected and what is not, and every deletion requires an explicit confirmation.":["Regisztr\u00e1lja a Database Cleaner eszk\u00f6zeit az AI Engine MCP-szerver\u00e9n, \u00edgy egy AI-asszisztens megvizsg\u00e1lhatja az adatb\u00e1zist, jelent\u00e9st k\u00e9sz\u00edthet a tiszt\u00edt\u00e1sra \u00e9rdemes t\u00e9telekr\u0151l, \u00e9s elv\u00e9gezheti a tiszt\u00edt\u00e1st. Az eszk\u00f6z\u00f6k jelzik, hogy mi v\u00e9dett \u00e9s mi nem, \u00e9s minden t\u00f6rl\u00e9shez kifejezett meger\u0151s\u00edt\u00e9s sz\u00fcks\u00e9ges."],"This requires AI Engine, with its MCP module enabled.":["Ehhez az AI Engine b\u0151v\u00edtm\u00e9nyre \u00e9s annak bekapcsolt MCP-modulj\u00e1ra van sz\u00fcks\u00e9g."],"Query Count":["Sz\u00e1ml\u00e1l\u00e1si lek\u00e9rdez\u00e9s"],"Query Delete":["T\u00f6rl\u00e9si lek\u00e9rdez\u00e9s"],"Run Count":["Futtat\u00e1sok sz\u00e1ma"],"Run Delete":["T\u00f6rl\u00e9s futtat\u00e1sa"],"Back":["Vissza"],"Add Custom":["Egy\u00e9ni hozz\u00e1ad\u00e1sa"],"The setup is not complete.":["A be\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00e1s m\u00e9g nem teljes."],"Optimize":["Optimaliz\u00e1l\u00e1s"],"Repair":["Jav\u00edt\u00e1s"],"Remove this table":["Ennek a t\u00e1bl\u00e1nak az elt\u00e1vol\u00edt\u00e1sa"],"Optimize this table (check the tutorial to 